<title>USA: Dm Management names Olga Conley CFO.</title>
<headline>Dm Management names Olga Conley CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HINGHAM, Mass 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>DM Management Co said Wednesday it named Olga Conley chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
<p>Conley is currently serves as vice president of finance and treasurer for the company.</p>
<p>She succeeds Samuel Shanaman, who remains chief operating officer and a member of the board of directors.</p>
